  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "解码入口：多格式调度",
      "items": [
        "setHints 按 POSSIBLE_FORMATS 组装 readers 数组，TRY_HARDER 时把 1D Reader 放到数组末尾",
        "decodeInternal 逐个 Reader.decode 并捕获 ReaderException 继续尝试，ALSO_INVERTED 时翻转矩阵再跑一轮"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "三层位图抽象",
      "items": [
        "LuminanceSource 只负责给灰度行/矩阵，平台差异（PlanarYUV、RGBLuminanceSource）都在子类",
        "Binarizer 决定阈值：HybridBinarizer 用 5x5 分块局部阈值，小图回退 GlobalHistogramBinarizer",
        "BinaryBitmap.getBlackMatrix 首次调用才二值化并缓存，1D Reader 命中时 2D 二值化完全不会发生"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "QR 双路径",
      "items": [
        "常规路径：Detector 找三个定位图案 → 透视变换 → sampleGrid 采样出模块矩阵",
        "PURE_BARCODE 路径：QRCodeReader.extractPureBits 直接从黑白边界推算模块大小，跳过定位"
      ]
    }
  ]
}